ate. He always comes on time.","options":[{"text":"is never","ok":true,"why":"never بعد از be می‌آید."},{"text":"never is","ok":false,"why":"با be، never بعد از فعل می‌آید."},{"text":"is not never","ok":false,"why":"not و never با هم نمی‌آیند."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"هیچ‌وقت گوشت نمی‌خورم.","frame":"I ___ eat meat.","answer":"never","accept":[],"why":"never + فعل."}]}],"version":"454f16a42995","order":111,"unit":2,"prerequisites":["lex:A1:be"],"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:before","headword":"before","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:before","pos":"preposition","gloss":"قبل از","meaning":"برای زمان: چیزی که زودتر از چیز دیگری اتفاق می‌افتد؛ مقابل after. بعد از آن اسم، فعل ing یا جملهٔ کامل می‌آید.","grammar":[{"pattern":"before + noun","note":"before lunch, before the meeting"},{"pattern":"before + verb-ing","note":"before going to bed"},{"pattern":"before + clause","note":"before you leave"}],"examples":[{"en":"Wash your hands before dinner.","fa":"قبل از شام دست‌هایت را بشوی."},{"en":"I always read a little before I go to sleep.","fa":"همیشه قبل از خواب کمی کتاب می‌خوانم."}],"collocations":["before lunch","before that","the day before yesterday","just before"],"mistake":{"wrong":"Before go to work, I have breakfast.","right":"Before I go to work, I have breakfast.","why":"بعد از before یا جملهٔ کامل با فاعل می‌آید یا فعل ing (before going)؛ فعل ساده به‌تنهایی نمی‌آید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/bɪˈfɔː/","us":"/bɪˈfɔːr/","note":"تکیه روی بخش دوم است: «بی‌فُ»."},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Please turn off the lights ___ you leave.","answer":"before","accept":[],"fa":"لطفاً قبل از رفتن چراغ‌ها را خاموش کن.","why":"before + جملهٔ کامل."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"I drink a glass of water ___ breakfast. Then I eat.","options":[{"text":"before","ok":true,"why":"Then I eat نشان می‌دهد آب را زودتر می‌نوشد."},{"text":"after","ok":false,"why":"after یعنی بعد از صبحانه، که با Then I eat جور نیست